# Frontend environment for the AWS Financial Services Advisor console.
# Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored by Vite) and edit as needed.
#
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the browser bundle.

# Base URL the browser uses for the FastAPI backend.
# Leave unset (or empty) in development: the app then calls the relative `/api`
# path, which `vite.config.ts` proxies to the backend.
# Set it for a deployed build (S3/CloudFront, nginx, ...) where no proxy exists:
# VITE_API_URL=https://compliance-api.example.com/api

# Dev-server-only knob (not exposed to the browser): where the Vite proxy sends
# `/api` requests. Defaults to http://localhost:8000.
# BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:8000
